msgid ""
"Remote IDs are becoming a legal requirement in some countries. Below is a "
"list of devices compatible with ArduPilot. There is a quite nice explanation"
" and list of frequently asked questions regarding Remote ID available `here "
"<https://drone-remote-id.com/>`__ (site hosted by Dronetag)"
msgstr ""
"在某些国家，远程 ID 正在成为法律要求。以下是兼容 ArduPilot 的设备列表。关于远程 ID 的详细解释和常见问题，可在 `此处 "
"<https://drone-remote-id.com/>`__ 找到一份相当不错的说明（该网站由 Dronetag 托管）"

