#: 9fd4e230eea44d8483983ce812f814bc
msgid ""
"In order to provide tamper protection, a special autopilot firmware must be "
"built and loaded on the autopilot which: enables this feature, prevents "
"loading non-compliant firmware via GCS or normal uploaders, and provides "
"further tamper-proofing."
